  "reason": "The existing evidence shows config_018 (0.706245 accuracy) is the best so far using scvi_n200 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, avgpool, and weighted fusion. This experiment tests replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation (more complex) while keeping other components the same, which could improve accuracy. The expected cost is ~5.5 GPU hours (moderate increase from 4.82), balancing exploitation of the current best setup with exploration of aggregation methods. This clarifies if transformer aggregation benefits this high-performing configuration."
